OL,3,AAirbnb host felt 'violated' after house
OL,4,Atrashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Airbnb host has described being too
OL,7,Fupset to return to her own home after
OL,8,Fit was trashed during a party.
OL,10,FLeanne Duff, from Plymouth, Devon, said
OL,11,Fshe felt "violated" after every room in
OL,12,Fher house was damaged in April,
OL,13,Fincluding her 13-year-old son's
OL,14,Fbedroom.
OL,16,FShe said food was smeared over the
OL,17,Fwalls, internal doors were removed and
OL,18,Fstacked in a room, a TV was smashed and
OL,19,Fher son's electric guitar had its
OL,20,Fstrings cut and his toys ripped.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
