OL,3,AAirbnb host felt 'violated' after house
OL,4,Atrashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAirbnb said it had removed a teenager
OL,7,Fwho booked the property from its
OL,8,Fplatform and reimbursed Duff the cost
OL,9,Fof damage to the property, while police
OL,10,Fsaid they could not prove among those
OL,11,Fpresent who caused it.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
